  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_theriac_cb9fe709c0f0aa49df653e4f2436a8987e7dd4294da98276e68315ce04399e342">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>theriac is an antidote to poison, especially to the bite of a venomous serpent (OED s.v. theriac n.); flore is the froth of a fermenting liquid (MED s.v. flori) | theriac, an antidote to poison, especially to the bite of a venomous serpent (OED s.v. theriac n.)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
